WEBVTT

00:00:07.399 --> 00:00:12.484
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> This painting is a self-portrait by the Dutch painter Vincent van Gogh.

00:00:14.353 --> 00:00:20.558
Van Gogh was born in Delft, in the Netherlands, on March 30, 1853.

00:00:22.788 --> 00:00:29.073
His parents weren’t poor – his father was a church minister, and his mother was an artist.

00:00:31.687 --> 00:00:37.170
There is only one known photograph of him, which is when he was 19 years old.

00:00:38.590 --> 00:00:44.686
We only have an idea of what he looked like as an adult because of his many self-portraits.

00:00:46.152 --> 00:00:51.264
He painted 35, all in the last four years of his life.

00:00:52.177 --> 00:00:57.036
He painted so many self-portraits because he was very poor,

00:00:57.255 --> 00:00:59.863
and it was cheaper than paying models.

00:01:01.516 --> 00:01:08.754
In 1888, when he was 35, van Gogh was in Arles, in the south of France.

00:01:11.193 --> 00:01:15.614
He was happy there because the light and the colors were beautiful.

00:01:16.094 --> 00:01:21.546
His friend, painter Paul Gaugin, was with him in Arles for a short time.

00:01:22.393 --> 00:01:25.010
Van Gogh was not strong mentally,

00:01:25.256 --> 00:01:29.257
and the relationship between van Gogh and Gaugin was difficult.

00:01:29.637 --> 00:01:34.370
After a big fight, van Gogh cut off part of his ear.

00:01:35.217 --> 00:01:38.861
He later painted a self-portrait with the injured ear.

00:01:41.089 --> 00:01:47.160
After that he was in a psychiatric hospital for some time in the south of France.

00:01:47.494 --> 00:01:55.801
This was his last self-portrait. He painted it in September 1889, when he was in the hospital.

00:01:57.457 --> 00:02:02.918
In this self-portrait, we see van Gogh as a painter for the very first time.

00:02:04.951 --> 00:02:14.265
Van Gogh died a few months later, on July 29, 1890. He was only 37 years old.

00:02:16.353 --> 00:02:22.065
His paintings weren’t popular during his lifetime, and he was never rich or famous.

00:02:22.252 --> 00:02:25.646
But today van Gogh’s pictures are everywhere.

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:32.195
People think that he is one of the greatest painters in the world,

00:02:32.441 --> 00:02:38.897
and his paintings, like “Sunflowers” and “The Starry Night,” sell for millions of dollars.